# Hex dictation configuration

This workspace is installed from Clusterfork. Edit the sources in
`@CLUSTERFORK@/hex/`, then run `uv run --no-project python hex/install.py`
from that repository to apply changes.

The canonical setup, rewrite policy, vocabulary rules, microphone profile,
and troubleshooting documentation is `@CLUSTERFORK@/docs/hex.md`.
Hex owns `AGENTS.md` and its generated editor typings in this workspace.
